677	   the old portal drifted out of alignment with itself.
678	   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
679	
680	/* One focus treatment for the whole product. Always visible, never removed —
681	   a ring that only shows on :focus-visible still has to exist. */
682	.k-focus:focus-visible {
683	  outline: 2px solid var(--brand-ring);
684	  outline-offset: 2px;
